{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ahoy, Seafarers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel the wind in your face, the deck beneath your feet and the salt on your lips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Seafarer: The Ship Sim is in Early Access. We\u2019d love for you to come aboard and launch your maritime career with us. The world, the ships, and the systems will grow update by update, and you\u2019re invited to watch and shape that journey as it happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/f0b712c50bf1e064b6bb3919f98adc17.poster.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/f0b712c50bf1e064b6bb3919f98adc17.webm?t=1771516522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We want you to enjoy life at sea. This isn't a high-realism work training simulator in which you have to memorize every bolt or tick off endless checklists before you even start the engine. Our goal is simple: Take things at your own pace on a huge open map. Follow a career path or jump straight into the action in quickplay. It\u2019s your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/302e456f3330ab50679a5ed123c63c92.poster.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/302e456f3330ab50679a5ed123c63c92.webm?t=1771516522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two days on the water are the same. Calm sunrises over quiet seas can turn into rough storms without warning. Dynamic waves, changing weather, and unexpected encounters make every voyage feel a little different and, hopefully, memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a growing fleet of vessels that range from small workboats to true giants of the sea. Patrol harbors and coastlines, load containers and bulk cargo with massive cranes, transport delicate LNG, answer distress calls, rescue stranded crews, fight fires, salvage lost freight, or guide huge ships safely into dock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or simply just enjoy the view from the bridge and snap a few pics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/4abd26936eac182e52bc773ad4a7c1e7.poster.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/4abd26936eac182e52bc773ad4a7c1e7.webm?t=1771516522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Check out the roadmap to see what\u2019s coming next. New vessels and features are on the way, while existing systems continue to be refined and polished. Multiplayer and ship customization are also on the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set sail today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Early Access means we\u2019re building this together. Your feedback, ideas, and reports genuinely help plot the course ahead. Join us on this voyage through the sometimes stormy seas of development and let\u2019s aim for smooth sailing toward full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/0ceb4666d8e55a7c962ce1b9ab6c18b7.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access title \u2013 actively developed and growing over time, with regular updates shaped by player feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living open world set on a huge map inspired by North European seas, ports, and coastlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox gameplay with dynamic weather, day &amp; night cycles, and unpredictable events \u2013 no two voyages are quite the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of a growing fleet of vessels, from small workboats to large seagoing ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands-on ship interaction: operate engines, handle cargo cranes, deploy water cannons, and dig into your vessel\u2019s systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your career path within factions \u2013 or jump straight into the action with quickplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own seafarer with the character editor and step onto the bridge as yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern visuals and realistic waves, powered by Unreal Engine 5 and NVIDIA WaveWorks 2.0, bringing sea and weather conditions to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come: New ships, features, and improvements will be added step-by-step as development continues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting your Feet wet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/fe560f85dff5263cdb710a1a4a0803d78e0a4b88.jpg"},{"name":"SEAL the Keel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/937a68270e051885ba2796f9baaab63c008dea42.jpg"},{"name":"On Course","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/aff69ea8df90e94068c930e57bec8327b54a82a0.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Certified","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/1e68a84f33dafb437bf954fb05277fb6358f1592.jpg"},{"name":"Cargo Handler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/8a6a09581817b7efa49bec063483699ecc00a816.jpg"},{"name":"First Responder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/d29978aa6f2dedc5201161bf4998fbc25073692e.jpg"},{"name":"Lifeguard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/d575efa5d545aff9c299f20b6b7eeaf49a7ef1af.jpg"},{"name":"Upgrade Ahoy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/0228e07013186624048bba396018754f3fcd40ba.jpg"},{"name":"Take what you can, give nothing back","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/1e1224a4e90644ac1276e8f69488b9a97b5cc7ac.jpg"},{"name":"Freshly Shipped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2582140/8ee5ab4f690ff077d6b8336149268d31161663ed.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2582140?t=1771516522","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/9f6a20613a88dd873a6d09b34096affc90dcc3e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771516522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/5dc5f21f32a9aa23c5fbc87fc5604a8cd737a9f4/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1771516522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/5dc5f21f32a9aa23c5fbc87fc5604a8cd737a9f4/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1771516522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/76a4b0429ad23558c295870ae2641f6a.avif?t=1771516522\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras_big/76a4b0429ad23558c295870ae2641f6a.avif?t=1771516522 width=1560 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rescue Update</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The second major content update for Seafarer brings Search and Rescue missions to your Tide Guard contract pool and expands your fleet with two new vessels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">New missions, dynamic events, and refined gameplay systems deepen life at sea. From pulling castaways from open waters to customizing your ship\u2019s appearance in the first iteration of the Ship Editor, this update meaningfully enriches your maritime journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>GET THE SUPPORTER EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/88a47ecbc202557965c5b4fd3ff69995.avif?t=1771516522\" width=616 height=902 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ahoy, Seafarers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel the wind in your face, the deck beneath your feet and the salt on your lips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Seafarer: The Ship Sim is in Early Access. We\u2019d love for you to come aboard and launch your maritime career with us. The world, the ships, and the systems will grow update by update, and you\u2019re invited to watch and shape that journey as it happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/f0b712c50bf1e064b6bb3919f98adc17.poster.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/f0b712c50bf1e064b6bb3919f98adc17.webm?t=1771516522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We want you to enjoy life at sea. This isn't a high-realism work training simulator in which you have to memorize every bolt or tick off endless checklists before you even start the engine. Our goal is simple: Take things at your own pace on a huge open map. Follow a career path or jump straight into the action in quickplay. It\u2019s your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/302e456f3330ab50679a5ed123c63c92.poster.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/302e456f3330ab50679a5ed123c63c92.webm?t=1771516522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">No two days on the water are the same. Calm sunrises over quiet seas can turn into rough storms without warning. Dynamic waves, changing weather, and unexpected encounters make every voyage feel a little different and, hopefully, memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a growing fleet of vessels that range from small workboats to true giants of the sea. Patrol harbors and coastlines, load containers and bulk cargo with massive cranes, transport delicate LNG, answer distress calls, rescue stranded crews, fight fires, salvage lost freight, or guide huge ships safely into dock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Or simply just enjoy the view from the bridge and snap a few pics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/4abd26936eac182e52bc773ad4a7c1e7.poster.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/4abd26936eac182e52bc773ad4a7c1e7.webm?t=1771516522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Check out the roadmap to see what\u2019s coming next. New vessels and features are on the way, while existing systems continue to be refined and polished. Multiplayer and ship customization are also on the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Set sail today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Early Access means we\u2019re building this together. Your feedback, ideas, and reports genuinely help plot the course ahead. Join us on this voyage through the sometimes stormy seas of development and let\u2019s aim for smooth sailing toward full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582140/extras/0ceb4666d8e55a7c962ce1b9ab6c18b7.avif?t=1771516522\" width=620 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access title \u2013 actively developed and growing over time, with regular updates shaped by player feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living open world set on a huge map inspired by North European seas, ports, and coastlines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox gameplay with dynamic weather, day &amp; night cycles, and unpredictable events \u2013 no two voyages are quite the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of a growing fleet of vessels, from small workboats to large seagoing ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands-on ship interaction: operate engines, handle cargo cranes, deploy water cannons, and dig into your vessel\u2019s systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your career path within factions \u2013 or jump straight into the action with quickplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own seafarer with the character editor and step onto the bridge as yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern visuals and realistic waves, powered by Unreal Engine 5 and NVIDIA WaveWorks 2.0, bringing sea and weather conditions to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More to come: New ships, features, and improvements will be added step-by-step as development continues.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["astragon Development"],"dlc":[4213410,4180110],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i